From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windowscodecs: metadata query enumerator; oleacc class factory; D3DXComputeNormalMap (3510)

windowscodecs: metadata query enumerator; oleacc: unknown class; d3dx9: D3DXComputeNormalMap

IWICMetadataQueryReader/Writer::GetEnumerator now lists the readers of a block ("/ifd", "/xmp") or the
items and nested readers at the current location ("/{ushort=256}", "/xmp:CreatorTool"), with working
Next/Skip/Reset/Clone; every string it returns resolves with GetMetadataByName.
oleacc DllGetClassObject answers CLASS_E_CLASSNOTAVAILABLE for classes it does not serve.
D3DXComputeNormalMap computes a normal map (Sobel slope of the chosen channel, mirror/wrap, invert sign,
occlusion in alpha) instead of returning success without touching the texture.
